        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"contents\": [{\n    \"parts\": [{\n      \"text\": \"Write a pure narration script for a YouTube video, 1200 words, English, calm 2nd-person voice ('you', 'your brain'). Topic: why you can't stop checking your phone. Rules: NO markdown, NO headers, NO stage directions, NO music cues, NO speaker labels, NO asterisks, NO brackets. Just plain narration text, nothing else. Rhythm: short sentences, one longer sentence every few lines, a question every 4-6 sentences. Include 3 real named researchers or studies woven naturally into the text. Open with a hook. End with a line that echoes the opening, reframed.\"\n    }]\n  }]\n}",
